# The corpus binary is never committed — see CLAUDE.md invariant 4.
# corpus/manifest.json pins it; the tool fetches and hash-verifies on first use.
corpus/*.sqlite
corpus/*.sqlite-*
corpus/*.zip
corpus/cache/

# Rust
/target/
**/*.rs.bk

